      "standardized_narrative": "Opening gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2023 were GBP 144.4m. During 2023 the syndicate's gross reserves reduced to GBP 60.4m at 31 December 2023, reflecting a combination of reinsurance to close activity and movements in claims provisions. Analysis of the claims development table shows a modest favourable prior-year development of c. GBP 2.5m (a ~1.7% release relative to opening reserves) attributable primarily to favourable emergence in longer-tail and Specialty classes. Primary drivers cited are favourable claims development in longer-tail lines and Specialty classes; notable prior-year loss events (e.g. Hurricane Ida, Winterstorm Uri, European and Australian floods and the Ukraine-related losses) remain referenced but were not quantified in the prior-year movement figure.",
